   608	```text
   609	[t^n] KJ = w^{35}(w-1)^{95} sum_q B1c_{n-1,q}(w-1)^q ( 99 q w - (99-3n)(33w-9) ).
   610	```
   611	
   612	Three facts at once: the lowest `w`-power is exactly **35** (so Jacobian rows with
