    80	```text
    81	B1c_{r,q}  =  coefficient of  x^{K-1-r-q} (y-x)^q  in B1        (deg B1 = K-1 = 32)
    82	row (D,k)  =  coefficient of  x^{D-k} y^k          in J,   D = n+m-2-p = 163-p
    83	```
