   131	### 0.4 The configuration trichotomy inside the row
   132	
   133	Moh p.209 ("the fourth case"): there is a unique `pi`-root `sigma` of `g` of the
   134	form `sigma = a_{-1}t^{-1} + a_0 + a_1 t + pi t^2` with
