   627	## 7. The exact obstruction to MINOR-EMPTY
   628	
   629	For a universal proof one must fix a complete datum
   630	
   631	```text
   632	(Moh skeleton, major tower, split order, multiplicity stratum,
   633	 branch series, face normalization, centre/gauge parameters)
   634	```
   635	
   636	and construct its actual joint ideal `I_lambda`.  Then one must establish all
   637	of the following uniformly.
   638	
   639	### O1. A sourced common global coefficient chart
   640	
   641	Moh Proposition 1.2 identifies roots of a local leader, Xu Proposition 7.3
   642	handles the order-one linear power, and Corollary 7.5 handles a full simple
   643	split in one contradiction proof.  None states that every later, partially
   644	split datum has the same globally defined tower leader with the coefficient
   645	incidence map used by the engines.  The special `(99,66)` and `D=108` maps were
   646	compiled case by case.
   647	
   648	### O2. A stratumwise polynomial presentation
   649	
   650	`p_red`, the row generators, the root-permutation action, and the localization
   651	must live in one declared ring.  A formula using `gcd(p,p')` across partition
   652	boundaries is not such a presentation.  This is a typing prerequisite for even
   653	stating `R in radical(I)`.
   654	
   655	### O3. An invertible pivot block after localizing at `R`
   656	
   657	A (possibly confluent) Vandermonde calculation may prove this part.  It would
   658	show that packet equations are independent on the genuine locus.  Kernel and
   659	resonance phenomena in Section 6 show that the required block and hypotheses
   660	must be specified; the discriminant alone need not control every Jacobian
   661	block.
   662	
   663	### O4. A nonzero augmented Schur row
   664	
   665	This is the decisive missing claim.  After the pivot block is inverted, one
   666	must prove that the remaining incidence/pole/Jacobian rows generate `1`, or,
   667	before localization, that they generate a power of `R`.  The affine right-hand
   668	side depends on the split partition, physical branch series, face
   669	normalization, jets, and low-tower coefficients.  The charged obstruction-core
   670	report expressly records that the final Schur scalar is not determined by
   671	`(d_s,u_s,V_s,delta,weights)` alone.
   672	
   673	### O5. General low-band closure and certificate lift
   674	
   675	The current small certificates work because other approximate-root blocks have
   676	not entered by the killing page.  No uniform support-onset theorem guarantees
   677	that for all data.  The `(99,66),delta=2` `C2/C3` inverse ledger, the
   678	`delta=5/2` pre-`D_2`/pre-major lift, and the `D=108` pre-major row lift are
   679	explicitly open at their earlier coordinate boundaries.  Exact certificates
   680	at the declared quotients remain valid, but they cannot be promoted to an
   681	arbitrary universal presentation by analogy.
   682	
   683	### O6. Chart coverage and normalizations
