+| raw with `u_s >= 2` | 6,117 | 4,012 | rows `4,389/1,728`; groups `2,896/1,116` |
+| upstream POLY/ODE `u_s >= 2` screen | 310 | 177 | groups `129/48` |
+| requested sharpened candidate cohort | **296** | **166** | rows `204/92`; groups **`124/42`** |
