+(D, m, (M_2,...,M_s), V_s),
+```
+
+so lower `V_i` assignments are merged. Here
+`u_s=d_s-V_s` and `v_s=V_s`; the driver's `Skel.u` is a different integration
+quantity and was not used. The 166 group distribution is
